# Kimmy, Hoverjet Outrider

> Kimmy is a magic-damage machine gun that cannot lock on. Her Spray Gun shots are skill shots, her attack speed is secretly magic power, and her meter rewards patience with piercing shots. Pick her when the enemy has to walk through her range to fight, not when they can cross it in one cast.

