Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Gold Magic DPS (Gold)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Feather of Heaven, Concentrated Energy, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Feather of Heaven, Concentrated Energy, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Sprint
- Flex: Tough Boots over Arcane Boots when Use when enemy crowd control decides the first trade before Kimmy can kite with Sprint.; Glowing Wand over Blood Wings when Use into Estes, Floryn, Ruby, Esmeralda, or shield-heavy drafts where Lifebane matters more than the final shield.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use against Saber, Hayabusa, Ling, or any dive that reaches Kimmy before her front line can peel.
- Total cost: 11810 gold

Default gold lane setup that turns Kimmy's magic basic attacks into sustained poke while keeping Sprint available for long kiting paths.

### Frontline Control (Gold)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Glowing Wand, Genius Wand, Ice Queen Wand, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Glowing Wand, Genius Wand, Divine Glaive
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Wilderness Blessing, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Holy Crystal over Ice Queen Wand when Use when the enemy front line is slow and you need faster carry kills instead of repeated slow stacks.; Concentrated Energy over Blood Wings when Use when fights last long enough for Recharge stacks to stay active and you are not being one-shot.; Tough Boots over Arcane Boots when Use when Purify alone cannot cover repeated stuns, knockups, or slows in the same fight.
- Total cost: 10850 gold

Control setup for durable or sustain-heavy drafts where Kimmy must keep tanks slowed, stripped of Magic Defense, and tagged by Lifebane.

### Jungle Tempo (Jungle)

