- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Ice Queen Wand over Holy Crystal when Use when Turtle and Lord fights are won by keeping divers inside Kimmy's spray path.; Blood Wings over Holy Crystal when Use when the enemy can reach the jungle backline and the movement shield buys a second firing angle.; Genius Wand over Glowing Wand when Use when the enemy draft has low healing and your team needs earlier Magic Defense shred before Divine Glaive.
- Total cost: 11760 gold

Jungle setup that uses Seasoned Hunter and Ice Retribution to stabilize clear speed, objective control, and chase angles around river fights.

